@startuml
actor User
participant "Folder List UI" as UI <<UI>>
participant ":FolderTestEndpoints" as FolderTestEndpoints <<Controller>>
participant ":SearchFolderQueryHandler" as SearchFolderQueryHandler <<Handler>>
participant ":ApplicationDbContext" as ApplicationDbContext <<DbContext>>
participant Database

note right of SearchFolderQueryHandler
  Managed by MediatR
end note

note right of ApplicationDbContext
  Managed by IoC
end note

User -> UI : Search folders
activate UI
UI -> FolderTestEndpoints : GET /api/Folder?folderName=...&shareMode=...
activate FolderTestEndpoints
FolderTestEndpoints -> SearchFolderQueryHandler : Handle(SearchFolderQuery)
deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
activate SearchFolderQueryHandler
SearchFolderQueryHandler -> ApplicationDbContext : Query folders + authors
deactivate SearchFolderQueryHandler
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext -> Database : Execute SQL
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate Database
Database --> ApplicationDbContext : Data
deactivate Database
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext --> SearchFolderQueryHandler : Folders + Authors
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate SearchFolderQueryHandler
SearchFolderQueryHandler -> FolderTestEndpoints : PaginatedList<SearchFolderDto>
deactivate SearchFolderQueryHandler
activate FolderTestEndpoints
FolderTestEndpoints --> UI : 200 OK (ApiResponse<PaginatedList<SearchFolderDto>>)
deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
UI -> User : Show search results
deactivate UI

@enduml